																		What is the **out** of universe reason for discontinuing MTF Omega 7 Pandoras Box?
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wirrkopf" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6599920); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6599920&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609559558" alt="Wirrkopf" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6599920)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wirrkopf" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6599920); return false;" >Wirrkopf</a></span> <span class="odate time_1594581049 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">12 Jul 2020 19:10</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4717457">
									

<p>The MTF Pandoras Box was discontinued by the foundation. The different Pages mentioning this MTF really made a point about it.</p>
<p>But was there a meta reason for it from a writing point of viev? Did the community <em>decide</em> not to use Pandoras Box anymore?</p>
<p>I'm especially curious about those reasons because in newer articles and tales MTF Tau 5 Samsara seems to have thaken the role<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-809564-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-809564-1')">1</a></sup> of Pandoras Box.<br />
If the reason was that Pandoras Box was to much like X-Men then it whould be strange to replace them with the [redacted for profanity] Power Rangers&#8230;</p>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-809564-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-809564-1')">1</a>. Being a <strong>really</strong> overpowered MTF that is able to defeat every entity with ease and comes out of every hazardous situation relatively unharmed</div>
</div>

							</div>

										<div class="signature">
					<hr class="signature-separator"/>
					

<p>Stop suggesting shooting annomalies into the sun!<br />
&quot;Why&quot; you ask? Do you want 001 - When Day Breaks?<br />
Because this is how you get 001 - When Day Breaks!</p>

				</div>
					
